1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,870
The Zodiac Killer mailed this.

2
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:04,440
For fifty-one years, nobody could read it.

3
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,360
Three hundred forty symbols.

4
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:10,540
Mailed to the San Francisco Chronicle in 1969.

5
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:14,310
The Zodiac killed at least five people in Northern California.

6
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:16,770
His first cipher fell in about a week.

7
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:17,980
This one didn't.

8
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:21,830
Then, in December 2020, three amateurs broke it.

9
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,210
A software developer in Virginia.

10
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:26,150
A mathematician in Australia.

11
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,770
A programmer in Belgium.

12
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:29,080
Their key insight:

13
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,890
it wasn't written left to right.

14
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,880
Most of it ran diagonally.

15
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,590
Down one row, across two.

16
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:38,830
The mathematician tested hundreds of thousands of reading orders.

17
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:41,290
The Belgian's program attacked each one.

18
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,350
Then, real English surfaced.

19
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,360
The FBI acknowledged the cipher had been solved.

20
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:47,760
So what did it say?

21
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:50,710
I hope you are having lots of fun in trying to catch

22
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:51,030
me.

23
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,990
That wasn't me on the TV show.

24
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:57,760
Probably a 1969 TV caller who claimed to be him.

25
00:00:58,140 --> 00:00:59,580
Fifty-one years of waiting.

26
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,520
For a taunt.

27
00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:01,660
No name.

28
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,760
The killer has never been identified.

29
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:07,000
And two shorter Zodiac ciphers remain unsolved.

30
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:09,180
One is just thirteen symbols.

31
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,610
Right before it, he wrote:

32
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:11,550
my name is.

33
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:13,230
Think you can read it?
